\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
  \item \textit{Latency} \((T_{\text{latency}})\): This value is calculated based on the time (in milliseconds) it takes between the first packet for a DNS request from the client to the last packet received for that request. This metric measures the responsiveness of the protocol and the ease of use.
