\section{Proposed Drone-BS Association and Resource Allocation Algorithm}

\subsection{Problem Formulation}
We first calculate the signal-to-interference plus noise ratio (SINR) of the $m$-th drone assuming it is scheduled to the $r$-th radio resource block (RRB) of the $l$-th BS. 
Assume that the drone's angular position is $(\theta_m, \phi_m)$. To formulate the optimization problem, 
