In this high-correlation scenario, Algorithm~\ref{alg:ls} demonstrates a clear advantage over Algorithm~\ref{alg:cd}. It maintains superior predictive accuracy relative to all baselines and excels at identifying the true effects despite the complexity of navigating the highly correlated predictor space.

