\subsection{\label{sec:Periodic hill flows}Periodic hill flows}

The computational domain of periodic hill flows is illustrated in Fig. \ref{Parameterized period hill geometries with different}. The simulations are conducted at Reynolds number $Re = 5600$. The detailed mesh configuration employed in the RANS simulations and DNS results can be found in Xiao et al. \cite{xiao_flows_2019}.

