Furthermore, the approximate weights exhibit numerical stability. As $m_n, M_n \to \infty$, the distribution of approximate weights satisfies the following asymptotic properties:
\begin{align}
\tilde{w}_1 &\approx \frac{2(m_n+M_n)^{1/2}}{4(m_n+M_n)^{1/2}-(m_n+1)^{1/2}} > \frac{1}{2}, \\
